{
  "bookId": "hero-214019",
  "id": "bond-35313",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "35313001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "一闪一闪亮晶晶~嘻嘻！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35313002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "咦？克拉拉在做什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35313003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "嗨，我的大摄影师，你觉得今天我要用这瓶蓝色的香水，还是红色的那瓶呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "35313005",
              "text": "蓝色的那瓶吧，比较清爽。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "35313005",
              "text": "红色的那瓶吧，更有个性。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "35313004",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35313005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "啧，土死了！正确答案是——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35313006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "统统丢掉！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35313007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "等一下，门口那些崭新的衣服和包难道也是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35313008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "都是要扔掉的垃圾。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35313009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "诶，为什么呢，刚买回来就不喜欢了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35313010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "逛街的时候还很喜欢，可是买回来就不喜欢了，咯咯咯。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35313011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "放心，它们会得到一个华丽又闪耀到爆的处理的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35313012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "也包括我吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35313013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "哈哈哈哈，真是可爱的问题！\n那么你想听到什么答案呢，大摄影师？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "35313",
